-L_{MDE} = \sum_{I_i \in S} \sum_{p \in P} M_i(p) \left( \| sg(\bar{D}_i(p)) - \bar{D}_i^*(p) \| + \| (w_i \cdot sg(\bar{D}_i(p)) + q_i) - \bar{D}_i^*(p) \| \right)
